SUMMARY:Wellington County Museum and Archives: Remembrance Ceremony
DESCRIPTION:Join us\, and members of the Royal Canadian Legion\, on the front lawn of the museum for a public ceremony to honour and remember the fallen from Wellington County. \nTo commemorate the contributions of the fallen (from WWI to Afghanistan from Wellington County)\, over 500 memorial markers will be placed on the front lawn at the Wellington County Museum and Archives.
