SUMMARY:Wellington County Museum and Archives: Candle Lighting
DESCRIPTION:To commemorate the contributions of the fallen (from WWI to Afghanistan from Wellington County)\, over 500 memorial markers will be placed on the front lawn at the Wellington County Museum and Archives. \nPlace a remembrance candle on each of the markers as a tribute to the fallen. This informal and poignant tribute takes place at dusk on November 10\, the candles will remain lit until November 12. \nCandles will be provided by the Museum and everyone is encouraged to attend.
