SUMMARY:Esquesing Historical Society: Canada Quilts
DESCRIPTION:Quilting has always been a part of our Canadian history\, especially in this climate! Rev. Nancy Rowe will present a newly completed “Canada Quilt” which illustrates moments in Canadian history. EHS Archivist Mark Rowe will bring the Shorncliffe Quilt from the Archives to discuss its role in World War I.
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/esquesing-historical-society-canada-quilts/
