SUMMARY:Historical Society of Ottawa - Songs of Old Bytown—A Special Sing-Along Event
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the soundtrack of the Bytown era. Join us in sharing the loggers’ songs of life in the shanties\, the Irish canal workers’ ballads\, love songs from the old country and songs of the English\, Scottish and French. Featuring Maura Volante singer\, researcher\, and teacher. \nThese songs are easy to learn—no previous musical experience required. All voices and ages are welcome!
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/historical-society-of-ottawa-songs-of-old-bytown-a-special-sing-along-event/
